advanced.description:
{Advanced Summon Diamond Golems}

Summons Diamond Golems to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Diamond Golems summoned is 50% greater than Basic Summon Diamond Golems.

expert.description:
{Expert Summon Diamond Golems}

Summons Diamond Golems to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Diamond Golems summoned is 100% greater than Basic Summon Diamond Golems.
